    },
    "body": "This PR implements Phase 1 and Phase 4 of the technical proposal: 1. Core structures (SemanticRouteReferenceV1, FacetRoute, SemanticSpaceManifestV1, ReasoningPlanV1, SemanticInferenceWitnessV1). 2. 1024-bit VSA binary hypervector operations (bind, unbind, bundle, permute, similarity, expand_atom). 3. Pluggable SemanticGeometry trait in the router crate. 4. Unit test coverage for CBOR types, VSA algebra, and selective backoff.",
